<div class="chapter-band"><div class="prose"><h2>Become a Knight</h2><p>Membership in the Knights of Columbus is open to practical Catholic men who are at least 18 years old. Members strengthen their faith, serve their communities, support families, and build lifelong fraternity.</p><p>The official Knights of Columbus application will help connect you with a local council. The Southern California Chapter does not maintain a separate application.</p><a class="button" href="https://www.kofc.org/joinus" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Start the official application</a></div><aside class="notice"><h2>Find a local council</h2><p>Explore the Chapter’s 21 districts and 74 currently listed council assignments, or use the official worldwide council finder.</p><p><a href="/councils/">View Chapter councils →</a><br><a href="https://www.kofc.org/get-involved/find-a-council/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Use the official council finder →</a></p></aside></div>
